WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.430
Welcome to Luggage Atlas.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:08.594
Your worldwide luggage directory keeps its own travel artwork, brand photography and
editorial design.

00:00:08.594 --> 00:00:13.942
Use it to explore products, compare exact offers and follow the latest dated updates.

00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:17.971
Choose Start browsing to open the product directory.

00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:22.380
Search a brand or model, then refine the product type or other filters.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.719
Each card keeps its size, color, market and price observation.

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:32.019
Photo labels tell you whether the image matches the exact offer or is a collection
reference.

00:00:32.517 --> 00:00:35.940
Select Compare this offer on up to four products.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.268
Open Compare to see your shortlist side by side.

00:00:39.268 --> 00:00:42.501
Prices keep their original currencies and dates.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:48.775
Review the product, dimensions, source details and photo evidence before deciding
which offers are comparable.

00:00:49.308 --> 00:00:54.138
Export selected CSV saves the comparison with source and photo links.

00:00:54.088 --> 00:00:57.634
You can also export a comparison with photographs.

00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:01.468
Clear the shortlist whenever you want to begin a new comparison.

00:01:01.975 --> 00:01:06.901
News and updates brings together dated launches, promotions and research additions.

00:01:06.851 --> 00:01:10.084
Open the source to check the original evidence.

00:01:10.084 --> 00:01:13.570
A catalog addition is different from a product launch.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:20.228
Return to Find luggage for feature filters, or explore the original product gallery
for outside and inside views.
